      "message": "Please add the bug that\u0027s tracking this work.\n\n----\n\nAre you sure you want this updated with every commit to this directory? I would have expected this is only desired whenever `gsc_utils` is rolled into Android, which would batch several commits together.\n\nAlternatively, leave it with default strings forever, and use the Android build ID to determine the version of `gsc_utils` that was used.\n\nAs a third alternative, I wonder if it\u0027s possible to refactor the code to move the uses of these definitions to a separate CrOS-specific file which is not included in the Android build at all, and then you can delete this file. I don\u0027t know how hard that would be to achieve though.",
